   "updated": 1763164800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Therefore every decision that matters is made in the broker, gated by: passphrase (challenge-response)\n· native UV with broker text · console passkey · trusted-manifest hash · pinned allow rules.\nHooks, TTY checks, env markers and Claude's own dialog are UX / T1 only.",
   "originalText": "Therefore every decision that matters is made in the broker, gated by: passphrase (challenge-response)\n· native UV with broker text · console passkey · trusted-manifest hash · pinned allow rules.\nHooks, TTY checks, env markers and Claude's own dialog are UX / T1 only.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
